      "writtenOn": "2020-04-28T18:24:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Personally I see value in avoiding different data flows. That\u0027s why I also added the TODO in cc.go, to clean up the reliance on objects in parallel with the libs, which currently has the same issue for coverage and sAbiDump cases. But very well then.\n\nSince depsToPaths collects WholeStaticLibs and WholeStaticLibObjs in parallel I think I\u0027d have to introduce a separate PathDeps.WholeStaticLibsFromPrebuilts to keep the prebuilts and non-prebuilts apart. Is that the way to go here?",
      "parentUuid": "b103814d_4b7d4927",
